WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.547
Are you lost?

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.385
Huh? So, you're waiting for someone?

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:20.020
Who are you waiting for?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:23.565
Can't you talk?

00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.735
Then why don't you say anything?

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:32.365
I'm... I'm not supposed to talk to...

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:38.413
I know, "Don't talk to strangers," right?

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:45.962
You're very grown-up because
you're careful. You can talk now.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.381
You should hear my story.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:53.553
My father and mother
and grandma and brother all got lost.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.680
Did you lose someone?

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:58.683
My mommy.

00:00:59.142 --> 00:01:00.351
Your mommy?

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:04.564
My mommy went away.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:09.069
I know. There've been
a lot of missing parents lately.

00:01:09.611 --> 00:01:12.947
But it's only your mom, you'll find her.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:21.998
Excuse me, this is Toshio Kimura.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.958
Can you please call his mom?

00:01:24.626 --> 00:01:25.460
Oh, he's lost?

00:01:25.543 --> 00:01:27.754
No, he's not, they were separated.

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:30.006
Right.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.385
And your first name, Mr. Kimura?

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:35.595
-Toshio.
-Toshio.

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:37.305
Toshio, then.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.475
Wait here a minute, OK?

00:01:43.186 --> 00:01:45.605
And you? Are you his sister?

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.690
No, no relation.

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.610
My whole family's lost.

